{
  "$description": "SalesOS DS v3 — Figma Variables handoff (no Figma API). Mirror of design-system/foundations.md + MUHIDE globals.css + V3AiPopup sizing. Import via Tokens Studio / Variables Import plugin, or recreate manually per figma-library.md / FIGMA_BUILD_CHECKLIST.md.",
  "meta": {
    "name": "SalesOS DS v3",
    "version": "0.1.1",
    "brand": {
      "primary": "#F57C1E",
      "mutedContrastSafe": "#8C8374"
    },
    "sources": [
      "docs/design/salesos-v3/design-system/foundations.md",
      "docs/design/salesos-v3/ai/ai-experience.md",
      "salesos/frontend/src/app/globals.css",
      "salesos/frontend/src/components/v3/V3AiPopup.tsx"
    ],
    "collections": [
      "Color/Light",
      "Color/Dark",
      "Space",
      "Radius",
      "Typography"
    ],
    "completeness": {
      "colorLightDarkParity": true,
      "spaceScale": "space/1…space/16 (4px grid) + shell + Ask AI popup",
      "radiusScale": "sm/md/lg/xl/2xl/pill",
      "textStyles": ["Display", "Title", "Subtitle", "Body", "Meta"],
      "effectStyles": ["elevation/sm", "elevation/md", "elevation/lg", "elevation/xl", "elevation/focus-ring"],
      "aiLayout": "modal popup only — use space/ai-popup-* and overlay/scrim; do not reserve page chrome for AI"
    },
    "notes": [
      "Color/Light and Color/Dark are separate collections (not dual-mode) so designers can bind Light→Dark aliases after publish.",
      "Muted text light uses #8C8374 (≥4.5:1 on white). Dark muted uses #A59E90 for AA on ink canvas (prefer over weaker host CSS if they diverge).",
      "Brand orange #F57C1E is primary CTA / border-active only — not decorative fill sprawl.",
      "Ask AI is a modal (V3AiPopup): max width space/ai-popup, max height space/ai-popup-max-h, scrim overlay/scrim. Never a docked rail.",
      "Opacity fields (surface/*, overlay/scrim) = COLOR with alpha in Figma.",
      "Do not claim Production GO from this file alone."
    ]
  },
